@OAuthDemo.ResourceApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5002
@AuthServer_HostAddress = https://localhost:7001

### Get access token for client-a (api.read)
POST {{AuthServer_HostAddress}}/connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=client_credentials&client_id=client-a&client_secret=secret-a&scope=api.read&resource=https://resource-api/

###

### Get access token for client-a (api.read api.write)
POST {{AuthServer_HostAddress}}/connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=client_credentials&client_id=client-a&client_secret=secret-a&scope=api.read%20api.write&resource=https://resource-api/

###

### Get access token for client-b (api.read)
POST {{AuthServer_HostAddress}}/connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=client_credentials&client_id=client-b&client_secret=secret-b&scope=api.read&resource=https://resource-api/

###

### Get access token for client-c (api.read api.write api.admin)
POST {{AuthServer_HostAddress}}/connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=client_credentials&client_id=client-c&client_secret=secret-c&scope=api.read%20api.write%20api.admin&resource=https://resource-api/

###

### Test GET /api/my-data with client-a token (expect 200)
GET {{OAuthDemo.ResourceApi_HostAddress}}/api/my-data
Authorization: Bearer {{client-a_token}}

###

### Test POST /api/my-data with client-a token (expect 200)
POST {{OAuthDemo.ResourceApi_HostAddress}}/api/my-data
Authorization: Bearer {{client-a_write_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "key": "test",
  "value": "test"
}

###

### Test GET /api/my-data with client-b token (expect 200)
GET {{OAuthDemo.ResourceApi_HostAddress}}/api/my-data
Authorization: Bearer {{client-b_token}}

###

### Test POST /api/my-data with client-b token (expect 403)
POST {{OAuthDemo.ResourceApi_HostAddress}}/api/my-data
Authorization: Bearer {{client-b_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "key": "test",
  "value": "test"
}

###

### Test GET /api/admin/summary with client-c token (expect 200)
GET {{OAuthDemo.ResourceApi_HostAddress}}/api/admin/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{client-c_token}}

###

### Test GET /api/admin/summary with client-a token (expect 403)
GET {{OAuthDemo.ResourceApi_HostAddress}}/api/admin/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{client-a_token}}

###
